        1       *================================================================*
        2       * PROGRAMA : CICBIN (ESQUELETO DA TURMA)                         *
        3       * AULA     : 1 - ECOSSISTEMA E PAPEIS                            *
        4       * OBJETIVO : IDENTIFICAR, PELO BIN DE 8 DIGITOS, A BANDEIRA, O   *
        5       *            EMISSOR E O PRODUTO DE CADA COMPRA E SIMULAR A      *
        6       *            DIVISAO DO VALOR ENTRE OS PARTICIPANTES:            *
        7       *            MDR (TAXA DE DESCONTO) = INTERCAMBIO (EMISSOR)      *
        8       *              + TARIFA DE BANDEIRA + RECEITA DO CREDENCIADOR    *
        9       *            LIQUIDO DO ESTABELECIMENTO = VALOR - MDR            *
       10       *            AS TAXAS SAO FICTICIAS, UMA POR PRODUTO.            *
       11       * ENTRADAS : DD BINTAB   - CPBIN, FB 80, ORDENADA POR BIN        *
       12       *            DD PEDIDOS  - CPAUTPED, FB 80                       *
       13       * SAIDA    : DD RELBIN   - RELATORIO, FBA 133                    *
       14       * RETORNO  : 0 = OK, 4 = HOUVE BIN NAO CADASTRADO,               *
       15       *            16 = ERRO DE ARQUIVO                                *
       16       * A ESCREVER NA AULA 1:                                          *
       17       * 2200-DIVIDIR-VALOR (AO VIVO, COM A TURMA)                      *
       18       * 3100-RESUMO-PARTICIPANTES (DESAFIO DO FIM DE SEMANA)           *
       19       *================================================================*
       20        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       21        PROGRAM-ID. CICBIN.
       22 
       23        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       24        INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       25        FILE-CONTROL.
       26            SELECT TABELA-BIN  ASSIGN TO BINTAB
       27                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-BIN.
       28            SELECT PEDIDOS     ASSIGN TO PEDIDOS
       29                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-PEDIDO.
       30            SELECT RELATORIO   ASSIGN TO RELBIN
       31                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-RELATORIO.
       32 
       33        DATA DIVISION.
       34        FILE SECTION.
       35        FD  TABELA-BIN
       36            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       37            COPY CPBIN.
       38        FD  PEDIDOS
       39            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       40            COPY CPAUTPED.
       41        FD  RELATORIO
       42            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       43        01  REG-RELATORIO              PIC X(132).
       44 
       45        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       46        01  WS-FS-BIN                  PIC X(02).
       47            88  WS-FS-BIN-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       48            88  WS-FS-BIN-FIM                    VALUE '10'.
       49        01  WS-FS-PEDIDO               PIC X(02).
       50            88  WS-FS-PED-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       51            88  WS-FS-PED-FIM                    VALUE '10'.
       52        01  WS-FS-RELATORIO            PIC X(02).
       53            88  WS-FS-REL-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       54 
       55       *--- TABELA DE BINS EM MEMORIA (SEARCH ALL) ---------------------*
       56       *    AS POSICOES NAO USADAS FICAM COM 99999999 PARA A TABELA
       57       *    CONTINUAR EM ORDEM CRESCENTE
       58        01  WS-MAX-BIN                 PIC 9(03) VALUE 50.
       59        01  WS-QTD-BIN                 PIC 9(03) VALUE ZERO.
       60        01  WS-TABELA-BIN.
       61            05  WS-BIN-ITEM OCCURS 50 TIMES
       62                            ASCENDING KEY IS WS-BIN-CODIGO
       63                            INDEXED BY IX-BIN.
       64                10  WS-BIN-CODIGO      PIC 9(08).
       65                10  WS-BIN-BANDEIRA    PIC X(10).
       66                10  WS-BIN-EMISSOR     PIC X(20).
       67                10  WS-BIN-PRODUTO     PIC X(01).
       68 
       69       *--- TAXAS FICTICIAS POR PRODUTO (PERCENTUAIS) ------------------*
       70       *    CREDITO: MDR 2,20  INTERCAMBIO 1,50  BANDEIRA 0,10
       71       *    DEBITO : MDR 1,10  INTERCAMBIO 0,50  BANDEIRA 0,05
       72       *    PRE-PAG: MDR 1,40  INTERCAMBIO 0,70  BANDEIRA 0,05
       73        01  WS-TAXAS.
       74            05  WS-TX-MDR              PIC 9(01)V9(04).
       75            05  WS-TX-INTERCAMBIO      PIC 9(01)V9(04).
       76            05  WS-TX-BANDEIRA         PIC 9(01)V9(04).
       77 
       78        01  WS-BIN-PEDIDO              PIC 9(08).
       79        01  WS-ACHOU-BIN               PIC X(01).
       80            88  WS-BIN-ENCONTRADO                VALUE 'S'.
       81            88  WS-BIN-NAO-ENCONTRADO            VALUE 'N'.
       82 
       83       *--- VALORES DE UMA COMPRA --------------------------------------*
       84        01  WS-VALORES.
       85            05  WS-VL-MDR              PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       86            05  WS-VL-INTERCAMBIO      PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       87            05  WS-VL-BANDEIRA         PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       88            05  WS-VL-CREDENCIADOR     PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       89            05  WS-VL-LIQUIDO          PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       90 
       91       *--- TOTAIS POR PARTICIPANTE ------------------------------------*
       92        01  WS-TOTAIS.
       93            05  WS-TT-VALOR            PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       94            05  WS-TT-MDR              PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       95            05  WS-TT-INTERCAMBIO      PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       96            05  WS-TT-BANDEIRA         PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       97            05  WS-TT-CREDENCIADOR     PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       98            05  WS-TT-LIQUIDO          PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       99 
      100        01  WS-CONTADORES.
      101            05  WS-QTD-LIDOS           PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
      102            05  WS-QTD-COMPRAS         PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
      103            05  WS-QTD-SEM-BIN         PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
      104            05  WS-QTD-IGNORADOS       PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
      105 
      106       *--- MASCARAMENTO -----------------------------------------------*
      107        01  WS-CONFERENCIA             PIC X(01) VALUE 'S'.
      108            88  WS-CONTAS-FECHAM                 VALUE 'S'.
      109            88  WS-CONTAS-NAO-FECHAM             VALUE 'N'.
      110 
      111        01  WS-CARTAO-ABERTO           PIC X(16).
      112        01  WS-CARTAO-MASC             PIC X(16).
      113 
      114       *--- LINHAS DO RELATORIO ----------------------------------------*
      115        01  WS-CAB-1.
      116            05  FILLER                 PIC X(60) VALUE
      117                'CICLO DO CARTAO - IDENTIFICACAO E DIVISAO DO VALOR'.
      118            05  FILLER                 PIC X(20) VALUE
      119                '(DADOS FICTICIOS)'.
      120        01  WS-CAB-2.
      121            05  FILLER                 PIC X(18) VALUE 'CARTAO'.
      122            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE 'BANDEIRA'.
      123            05  FILLER                 PIC X(22) VALUE 'EMISSOR'.
      124            05  FILLER                 PIC X(04) VALUE 'PRD'.
      125            05  FILLER                 PIC X(14) VALUE '         VALOR'.
      126            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE '         MDR'.
      127            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE ' INTERCAMBIO'.
      128            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE '    BANDEIRA'.
      129            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE ' CREDENCIAD.'.
      130            05  FILLER                 PIC X(14) VALUE '       LIQUIDO'.
      131        01  WS-DETALHE.
      132            05  DT-CARTAO              PIC X(16).
      133            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      134            05  DT-BANDEIRA            PIC X(10).
      135            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      136            05  DT-EMISSOR             PIC X(20).
      137            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      138            05  DT-PRODUTO             PIC X(01).
      139            05  FILLER                 PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
      140            05  DT-VALOR               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      141            05  DT-MDR                 PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      142            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      143            05  DT-INTERCAMBIO         PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      144            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      145            05  DT-TARIFA              PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      146            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      147            05  DT-CREDENCIADOR        PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      148            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      149            05  DT-LIQUIDO             PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      150        01  WS-LINHA-SEM-BIN.
      151            05  SB-CARTAO              PIC X(16).
      152            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      153            05  FILLER                 PIC X(40) VALUE
      154                'BIN NAO CADASTRADO: COMPRA NAO ROTEADA'.
      155        01  WS-LINHA-TOTAL.
      156            05  LT-DESCRICAO           PIC X(50).
      157            05  LT-VALOR               PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      158        01  WS-LINHA-CONFERE.
      159            05  CF-TEXTO               PIC X(60).
      160            05  CF-RESULTADO           PIC X(20).
      161 
      162        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      163        0000-PRINCIPAL.
      164            PERFORM 1000-INICIALIZAR THRU 1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR
      165            PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR   THRU 2000-FIM-PROCESSAR
      166               UNTIL WS-FS-PED-FIM
      167            PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR   THRU 3000-FIM-FINALIZAR
      168            STOP RUN.
      169 
      170        1000-INICIALIZAR.
      171 
      172            OPEN INPUT TABELA-BIN
      173            IF NOT WS-FS-BIN-OK
      174               DISPLAY 'CICBIN - ERRO DE OPEN TABELA-BIN (BINTAB) FS: '
      175                       WS-FS-BIN
      176               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      177            END-IF
      178            OPEN INPUT PEDIDOS
      179            IF NOT WS-FS-PED-OK
      180               DISPLAY 'CICBIN - ERRO DE OPEN PEDIDOS (PEDIDOS) FS: '
      181                       WS-FS-PEDIDO
      182               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      183            END-IF
      184            OPEN OUTPUT RELATORIO
      185            IF NOT WS-FS-REL-OK
      186               DISPLAY 'CICBIN - ERRO DE OPEN RELATORIO (RELBIN) FS: '
      187                       WS-FS-RELATORIO
      188               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      189            END-IF
      190 
      191            PERFORM 1100-CARREGAR-BINS THRU 1100-FIM-CARREGAR-BINS
      192 
      193            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-CAB-1 AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
      194            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-CAB-2 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
      195            MOVE SPACES TO REG-RELATORIO
      196            WRITE REG-RELATORIO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      197 
      198            PERFORM 8000-LER-PEDIDO THRU 8000-FIM-LER-PEDIDO
      199            .
      200        1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR.
      201            EXIT.
      202 
      203        1100-CARREGAR-BINS.
      204       *    POSICOES VAZIAS COM O MAIOR BIN POSSIVEL (ORDEM CRESCENTE)
      205            PERFORM VARYING IX-BIN FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX-BIN > WS-MAX-BIN
      206               MOVE 99999999 TO WS-BIN-CODIGO(IX-BIN)
      207            END-PERFORM
      208            READ TABELA-BIN
      209            PERFORM UNTIL WS-FS-BIN-FIM
      210               ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-BIN
      211               IF WS-QTD-BIN > WS-MAX-BIN
      212                  DISPLAY 'CICBIN - TABELA DE BINS MAIOR QUE O LIMITE'
      213                  PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      214               END-IF
      215               MOVE BN-BIN           TO WS-BIN-CODIGO(WS-QTD-BIN)
      216               MOVE BN-NOME-BANDEIRA TO WS-BIN-BANDEIRA(WS-QTD-BIN)
      217               MOVE BN-NOME-EMISSOR  TO WS-BIN-EMISSOR(WS-QTD-BIN)
      218               MOVE BN-PRODUTO       TO WS-BIN-PRODUTO(WS-QTD-BIN)
      219               READ TABELA-BIN
      220            END-PERFORM
      221            CLOSE TABELA-BIN
      222            DISPLAY 'CICBIN - BINS CARREGADOS ......: ' WS-QTD-BIN
      223            .
      224        1100-FIM-CARREGAR-BINS.
      225            EXIT.
      226 
      227        2000-PROCESSAR.
      228       *    SO AS COMPRAS (0100, 0200 E O AVISO 0120) ENTRAM NA DIVISAO;
      229       *    SAQUES E REVERSOES NAO SAO VENDAS DE UM ESTABELECIMENTO
      230            IF (PD-PEDIDO-DUPLA OR PD-PEDIDO-UNICA OR PD-AVISO-STANDIN)
      231               AND PD-COMPRA
      232               ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-COMPRAS
      233               PERFORM 2100-IDENTIFICAR THRU 2100-FIM-IDENTIFICAR
      234               IF WS-BIN-ENCONTRADO
      235                  PERFORM 2200-DIVIDIR-VALOR THRU 2200-FIM-DIVIDIR-VALOR
      236                  PERFORM 2300-IMPRIMIR      THRU 2300-FIM-IMPRIMIR
      237               ELSE
      238                  ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-SEM-BIN
      239                  MOVE PD-NUM-CARTAO TO WS-CARTAO-ABERTO
      240                  PERFORM 9800-MASCARAR-CARTAO
      241                  MOVE WS-CARTAO-MASC TO SB-CARTAO
      242                  WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-LINHA-SEM-BIN
      243                        AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      244               END-IF
      245            ELSE
      246               ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-IGNORADOS
      247            END-IF
      248            PERFORM 8000-LER-PEDIDO THRU 8000-FIM-LER-PEDIDO
      249            .
      250        2000-FIM-PROCESSAR.
      251            EXIT.
      252 
      253        2100-IDENTIFICAR.
      254       *    O BIN SAO OS 8 PRIMEIROS DIGITOS DO NUMERO DO CARTAO
      255            MOVE PD-NUM-CARTAO(1:8) TO WS-BIN-PEDIDO
      256            SEARCH ALL WS-BIN-ITEM
      257               AT END
      258                  SET WS-BIN-NAO-ENCONTRADO TO TRUE
      259               WHEN WS-BIN-CODIGO(IX-BIN) = WS-BIN-PEDIDO
      260                  SET WS-BIN-ENCONTRADO     TO TRUE
      261            END-SEARCH
      262            .
      263        2100-FIM-IDENTIFICAR.
      264            EXIT.
      265        2200-DIVIDIR-VALOR.
      266            EVALUATE WS-BIN-PRODUTO(IX-BIN)
      267               WHEN 'C'
      268                  MOVE 2.2000 TO WS-TX-MDR
      269                  MOVE 1.5000 TO WS-TX-INTERCAMBIO
      270                  MOVE 0.1000 TO WS-TX-BANDEIRA
      271                WHEN 'D'
      272                  MOVE 1.1000 TO WS-TX-MDR
      273                  MOVE 0.5000 TO WS-TX-INTERCAMBIO
      274                  MOVE 0.0500 TO WS-TX-BANDEIRA
      275                WHEN OTHER 
      276                  MOVE 1.4000 TO WS-TX-MDR 
      277                  MOVE 0.7000 TO WS-TX-INTERCAMBIO
      278                  MOVE 0.0500 TO WS-TX-BANDEIRA
      279            END-EVALUATE
      280 
      281            COMPUTE WS-VL-MDR ROUNDED =
      282                    PD-VALOR * WS-TX-MDR / 100
      283 
      284            COMPUTE WS-VL-INTERCAMBIO ROUNDED =
      285                    PD-VALOR * WS-TX-INTERCAMBIO / 100
      286 
      287            COMPUTE WS-VL-BANDEIRA ROUNDED =
      288                    PD-VALOR * WS-TX-BANDEIRA / 100
      289 
      290            COMPUTE WS-VL-CREDENCIADOR =
      291                    WS-VL-MDR
      292                  - WS-VL-INTERCAMBIO
      293                  - WS-VL-BANDEIRA
      294 
      295            COMPUTE WS-VL-LIQUIDO =
      296                    PD-VALOR
      297                  - WS-VL-MDR
      298 
      299            ADD PD-VALOR               TO WS-TT-VALOR
      300            ADD WS-VL-MDR              TO WS-TT-MDR
      301            ADD WS-VL-INTERCAMBIO      TO WS-TT-INTERCAMBIO
      302            ADD WS-VL-BANDEIRA         TO WS-TT-BANDEIRA
      303            ADD WS-VL-CREDENCIADOR     TO WS-TT-CREDENCIADOR
      304            ADD WS-VL-LIQUIDO          TO WS-TT-LIQUIDO
      305            .
      306        2200-FIM-DIVIDIR-VALOR.
      307            EXIT.
      308 
      309        2300-IMPRIMIR.
      310            MOVE PD-NUM-CARTAO            TO WS-CARTAO-ABERTO
      311            PERFORM 9800-MASCARAR-CARTAO
      312            MOVE WS-CARTAO-MASC           TO DT-CARTAO
      313            MOVE WS-BIN-BANDEIRA(IX-BIN)  TO DT-BANDEIRA
      314            MOVE WS-BIN-EMISSOR(IX-BIN)   TO DT-EMISSOR
      315            MOVE WS-BIN-PRODUTO(IX-BIN)   TO DT-PRODUTO
      316            MOVE PD-VALOR                 TO DT-VALOR
      317            MOVE WS-VL-MDR                TO DT-MDR
      318            MOVE WS-VL-INTERCAMBIO        TO DT-INTERCAMBIO
      319            MOVE WS-VL-BANDEIRA           TO DT-TARIFA
      320            MOVE WS-VL-CREDENCIADOR       TO DT-CREDENCIADOR
      321            MOVE WS-VL-LIQUIDO            TO DT-LIQUIDO
      322            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-DETALHE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      323            IF NOT WS-FS-REL-OK
      324               DISPLAY 'CICBIN - ERRO DE WRITE NO RELBIN FS: '
      325                       WS-FS-RELATORIO
      326               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      327            END-IF
      328            .
      329        2300-FIM-IMPRIMIR.
      330            EXIT.
      331 
      332        3000-FINALIZAR.
      333            PERFORM 3100-RESUMO-PARTICIPANTES
      334               THRU 3100-FIM-RESUMO-PARTICIPANTES
      335            CLOSE PEDIDOS RELATORIO
      336            DISPLAY 'CICBIN - PEDIDOS LIDOS ........: ' WS-QTD-LIDOS
      337            DISPLAY 'CICBIN - COMPRAS ..............: ' WS-QTD-COMPRAS
      338            DISPLAY 'CICBIN -   COM BIN NAO CADASTR.: ' WS-QTD-SEM-BIN
      339            DISPLAY 'CICBIN - IGNORADOS (SAQUE/REV.): ' WS-QTD-IGNORADOS
      340            EVALUATE TRUE
      341               WHEN WS-CONTAS-NAO-FECHAM
      342                  MOVE 8 TO RETURN-CODE
      343               WHEN WS-QTD-SEM-BIN > ZERO
      344                  MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
      345               WHEN OTHER
      346                  MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
      347            END-EVALUATE
      348            .
      349        3000-FIM-FINALIZAR.
      350            EXIT.
      351 
      352        3100-RESUMO-PARTICIPANTES.
      353       *    A ESCREVER (DESAFIO): IMPRIMIR NO RELATORIO O RESUMO POR
      354       *    PARTICIPANTE (ESTABELECIMENTOS, CREDENCIADOR, EMISSORES,
      355       *    BANDEIRAS) COM AS LINHAS WS-LINHA-TOTAL E PROVAR QUE:
      356       *    1. VALOR = LIQUIDO + MDR
      357       *    2. MDR = INTERCAMBIO + BANDEIRA + CREDENCIADOR
      358       *    SE ALGUMA CONTA NAO FECHAR: SET WS-CONTAS-NAO-FECHAM TO TRUE.
      359            CONTINUE
      360            .
      361        3100-FIM-RESUMO-PARTICIPANTES.
      362            EXIT.
      363 
      364        8000-LER-PEDIDO.
      365            READ PEDIDOS
      366                 AT END
      367                    CONTINUE
      368                 NOT AT END
      369                    ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-LIDOS
      370            END-READ
      371            IF NOT WS-FS-PED-OK AND NOT WS-FS-PED-FIM
      372               DISPLAY 'CICBIN - ERRO DE READ PEDIDOS FS: ' WS-FS-PEDIDO
      373               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      374            END-IF
      375            .
      376        8000-FIM-LER-PEDIDO.
      377            EXIT.
      378 
      379            COPY CPMASCAR.
      380 
      381        9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO.
      382       *    ENCERRA COM RC 16 PARA IMPEDIR OS STEPS SEGUINTES
      383            MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
      384            STOP RUN
      385            .
